/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Congratulations to our talented writers who have shown remarkable grit in their pursuit of delivering unique and crucial messages of empathy to readers around the globe. These authors have demonstrated the skill to compose narratives that deeply explore the powerful human quality of empathy.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I applaud their commitment and the passion-driven motivation to induce positive change in the human condition. Our young writers and entrants to the Elaine Hobson literary festival have been identified as highly competent in the craft of narrative composition. Every student who submitted their writing has been acknowledged, and we are so proud of you all.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
