/S /H3
/T (It was a fulfilling process for me; I felt that I discovered a lot more about myself through writing this and I appreciate how it allowed me to express my feelings through words. The highlight for me was definitely when I finished my final draft and the piece turned out to be much better than I had originally planned, everything flowed together and worked well. It was challenging to fit my story into 500 words, it forced me to be direct and only keep what was essential, but the word limit helped me write a better story in the end as it made the important parts shined through.                                                                                          - Aarav Aggarwal                                                                                                                                                                             )
/E (It was a fulfilling process for me; I felt that I discovered a lot more about myself through writing this and I appreciate how it allowed me to express my feelings through words. The highlight for me was definitely when I finished my final draft and the piece turned out to be much better than I had originally planned, everything flowed together and worked well. It was challenging to fit my story into 500 words, it forced me to be direct and only keep what was essential, but the word limit helped me write a better story in the end as it made the important parts shined through.                                                                                          - Aarav Aggarwal                                                                                                                                                                             )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
