522 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Empathy is a powerful force that forms the backbone of public and personal relationships. It is widely known that empathy is fundamental to maintaining healthy relationships because it ensures that the needs and worries of each party in the relationship are adequately addressed. Even so, empathy goes beyond strengthening relationships: it can improve the world. Small, daily acts of empathy have the potential to enact impressive change, both in the public and private spheres. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
