543 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In an apartment above the hustle of the city, the melodies of a piano danced through the air, playing the notes of an age-old symphony. Inside was a young woman, completely absorbed in her music. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
544 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Her name was Lila; a college student, and pianist on the side. As the last dregs of notes rippled away, she returned to her surroundings, back in the throes of life. She typed a quick caption and hit the post on the video she was taking. Lila doubted her followers would feel her music as she did. No one ever did. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
