/T (The highlight of this experience was writing my story and bringing what was originally a vague idea to life on paper. I enjoyed experimenting with my writing, using different ways to describe my characters, building up their personalities, and reflecting the main idea of empathy in my story. Although it was challenging, the satisfaction I felt at the end of the process made the struggles worthwhile.                                                                                                         - Annika Jain                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                )
