/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
576 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I kept wondering what I should do. Prof. Kashyap was known for his difficult attitude and lack of empathy for his students. Denise was a student in an exchange program, and I was in charge of making sure she assimilated. The recollection of my challenges adjusting to a new language and culture intensified as I watched Denise's plight unfold. I felt a sudden surge of indignation. With resolve coursing through my veins, I approached Denise, my steps purposeful. I held her hand and urged her to come with me and together, we made our way to the staff room, where Professor Kashyap was engrossed in his affairs. Ignoring his dismissive glance, I turned to face him, my voice steady as I spoke. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
