/ActualText (The best part was showing how I began to care more about Denise and eventually stood up for her. It felt incredibly rewarding to write about kindness and defending others. The hardest part was ensuring the story felt genuine and not like a lesson on being nice. I wanted readers to experience empathy naturally, without it feeling forced. )
