600 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (universal brotherhood, it brings about commonalities. Could you imagine a world where empathy is rampant? Businesses would incorporate sustainable materials into products despite the costs, prioritizing the environment. Those afflicted by mental health issues would cease to be lambasted but encouraged by others, who would focus on the root cause of their issue, to seek assistance, making them feel worthy and heard. Empathy could break the shackles of the bigots' mind by allowing him to feel the anguish of the victim and contest the purpose, reward and impact of his actions. The quavering pleas of the scarred will penetrate the ruthlessness of those political leaders who dismiss the ubiquitous corpses in the soil to their greed for ambition, power and imposition of ideology. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
