/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (It shows the reader first-hand, an important component of empathy: that one can and should have empathy for anyone, regardless of their identity, situation, or what one knows about these. It also serves to cause readers who may have adverse reactions to realizing that the subject was a cat to question certain attitudes they may have and to, hopefully, actively incorporate more empathy for all into their lives.                                                                                              Azadeh Changrani-Rastogi)
/E (It shows the reader first-hand, an important component of empathy: that one can and should have empathy for anyone, regardless of their identity, situation, or what one knows about these. It also serves to cause readers who may have adverse reactions to realizing that the subject was a cat to question certain attitudes they may have and to, hopefully, actively incorporate more empathy for all into their lives.                                                                                              Azadeh Changrani-Rastogi)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [13]
>>
