643 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Compassionate empathy \(also known as empathic concern\) goes beyond simply understanding others and sharing their feelings: it moves us to take action, to help however we can \(Bariso, 2018\). )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
644 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
