/ActualText (Today, the relevance of empathy cannot be overstated, especially in an era where polarization runs rampant. The global refugee crisis presents a poignant example of the necessity of empathy. Stories of families torn apart by war and persecution, demand a response rooted in empathy. It is empathy that moves individuals and)
