/ActualText (Empathy is the crucial, yet invisible thread that binds humanity. It is a fundamental aspect of our existence that enables us to connect, understand and support one another. From the personal to the global scale, the value of empathy is undeniable. It challenges us to look beyond ourselves, to see the world through the eyes of others, and to act with compassion and understanding. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
653 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We must strive to cultivate empathy within ourselves and our communities, for it is through empathy alone that we find our common humanity, and it is through humanity, that we can make the world a better place for all. )
