700 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (However, empathy is a broad term and to truly understand its positive impact, it can be analysed through its socially prescribed three types: Cognitive Empathy, Emotional Empathy and Compassionate Empathy. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
701 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
702 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Secondly, emotional empathy is the practice of sharing an emotional experience with another person and truly understanding how they feel. Recently, someone in my grade who had never been a close friend faced a family tragedy. Despite not being close friends, because of the visible impact on him, and the people around him, I was deeply affected by the loss. In such a situation, when someone is displaying signs of personal distress, you would consider the situation and compare their behaviour using your own experiences and then draw a pattern of their life to get to the issue. That is emotional empathy, essentially involving recognizing the emotions of others and motivating you to respond with kindness and compassion which helps create connections. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
