/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (If ten-year-old students can demonstrate emotional intelligence and empathy, then why can't we? Empathy isn't merely understanding someone else's situation; it's about responding with compassion. The teachers who tirelessly support us deserve our empathy and appreciation, and it shouldn't require a wake-up call for us to recognize that fact. Let's strive to emulate the empathy of these young students and show our gratitude and support for those who enrich our lives.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
