/T (This experience provided me with an opportunity to delve into the essence of empathy, recognising it as a quality that every individual must possess. Exploring empathy at its core was undoubtedly a highlight, offering insights that resonated deeply within me. However, crafting a story that could effectively convey these insights and make a lasting impact proved to be the most challenging aspect. Nevertheless, navigating through this challenge enabled me to refine my storytelling abilities and deepen my understanding of empathy.                                                                                                            -  Naisha Sahney                                                                                                                                                                                                                            )
