/ActualText (The ancient Indian text Arthashastra underlines the significance of empathy in leadership. Chanakya, the author, writes "The king should be like a father to his subjects. He should be compassionate and understanding. He should always strive to do what is best for the welfare of his people." This emphasis on compassionate leadership influenced numerous prominent figures throughout history.                                                                                                                       )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [9]
>>
