/T (The universality of empathy transcends all cultural and religious boundaries. In a world often driven by ideologies, conflict, and prejudice, empathy serves as a crucial tool for understanding others and fostering connections. It bridges the divides that separate us, paving the way for a more harmonious world. So the first step is to choose empathy. The second step is to Listen, Engage, & Connect. By embracing empathy, we can become a strong, understanding, inclusive, and shared humanity as global citizens.                                                                                                 )
/E (The universality of empathy transcends all cultural and religious boundaries. In a world often driven by ideologies, conflict, and prejudice, empathy serves as a crucial tool for understanding others and fostering connections. It bridges the divides that separate us, paving the way for a more harmonious world. So the first step is to choose empathy. The second step is to Listen, Engage, & Connect. By embracing empathy, we can become a strong, understanding, inclusive, and shared humanity as global citizens.                                                                                                 )
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [4]
