/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (I scan the deserted street below rather pointlessly: no one ever strays here. No one ever will. The bitter, frosty winds screech, but they cannot hurt me: I am but a hollow reflection. I stroll closer still, gazing at the glimmer of ochre, azure and snow-building lights, and the tranquil lapping of the Hudson. The serenity almost makes me want to stay. )
/E (I scan the deserted street below rather pointlessly: no one ever strays here. No one ever will. The bitter, frosty winds screech, but they cannot hurt me: I am but a hollow reflection. I stroll closer still, gazing at the glimmer of ochre, azure and snow-building lights, and the tranquil lapping of the Hudson. The serenity almost makes me want to stay. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
788 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Slowly, I hoist myself over the railing, unwittingly plunging my hand into the shards of a shattered beer bottle. Numbly, I watch the crimson oozing out, softening hewn stone, and feeling nothing. Empty. Is it mine? Pressing down harder, serrated fragments piercing my palm, I vault across. Momentarily, I lean back, resting on the grille, letting my feet dangle over the alluring sidewalk, thirteen floors down. )
/E (Slowly, I hoist myself over the railing, unwittingly plunging my hand into the shards of a shattered beer bottle. Numbly, I watch the crimson oozing out, softening hewn stone, and feeling nothing. Empty. Is it mine? Pressing down harder, serrated fragments piercing my palm, I vault across. Momentarily, I lean back, resting on the grille, letting my feet dangle over the alluring sidewalk, thirteen floors down. )
