811 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (To me, the concept of empathy has been intrinsic to the development of human society. I've found that even the smallest acts of compassion in an environment like school have the potential to shape people's futures. The highlight was expressing myself on a topic that's deeply close to my heart: teenage suicide. I find it exceptionally devastating that so many students, especially in my home country \(India\), feel the need to succumb to social pressures, be it educational or romantic.  This piece allowed me to put myself into the shoes of one such individual and I was able to effectively reflect on how to better represent such characters in my works going forward. Most importantly, it allowed me to empathise with those afflicted with these difficulties.                                                                                        - Param Davda)
/E (To me, the concept of empathy has been intrinsic to the development of human society. I've found that even the smallest acts of compassion in an environment like school have the potential to shape people's futures. The highlight was expressing myself on a topic that's deeply close to my heart: teenage suicide. I find it exceptionally devastating that so many students, especially in my home country \(India\), feel the need to succumb to social pressures, be it educational or romantic.  This piece allowed me to put myself into the shoes of one such individual and I was able to effectively reflect on how to better represent such characters in my works going forward. Most importantly, it allowed me to empathise with those afflicted with these difficulties.                                                                                        - Param Davda)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
