/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This invisibility lies in the unspoken understanding of the Indo-Pak line of control in Kashmir. In every synchronised footstep that trudges in ankle-deep snow. In every knowing glance of resolute duty across unnervingly hostile borders. In every moment this hostility thaws to unmatched respect for unyielding national service. If only I saw not through closing eyelids watching the news but the steadfast stand of a fearless soldier, I would understand: not every enemy wants to fight a war, not every man across a border makes an enemy and not every border built by power-hungry politics dictates the terms of brotherhood.                                                        )
/E (This invisibility lies in the unspoken understanding of the Indo-Pak line of control in Kashmir. In every synchronised footstep that trudges in ankle-deep snow. In every knowing glance of resolute duty across unnervingly hostile borders. In every moment this hostility thaws to unmatched respect for unyielding national service. If only I saw not through closing eyelids watching the news but the steadfast stand of a fearless soldier, I would understand: not every enemy wants to fight a war, not every man across a border makes an enemy and not every border built by power-hungry politics dictates the terms of brotherhood.                                                        )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [6]
>>
