/T (Writing about empathy led me to realise its presence in the subtlest of gestures, from a mere nod to decisive choices which yield profound consequences. It can hide in something as simple as a verbal yes or no, yet lead to something as tangled as a war or as noble as saving a life. This exploration, helped me in gaining insight into its complex layers and the significance of acknowledging richly empathetic acts.                                                                                                                                                  - Parthivi Kapur)
