/T (With my school cheering me on, I felt unstoppable. Immediately after the surgery, I had ten tubes, perhaps more, emerging from several parts of my body. Sleeping with so many contraptions attached to me in the cold ICU was nearly impossible. I was all alone and missed my parents terribly since they were allowed to visit me only at certain times of the day. In those times, the nurses would stay up and regale me with stories from their hometowns and how even they missed their friends and parents back home.)
/E (With my school cheering me on, I felt unstoppable. Immediately after the surgery, I had ten tubes, perhaps more, emerging from several parts of my body. Sleeping with so many contraptions attached to me in the cold ICU was nearly impossible. I was all alone and missed my parents terribly since they were allowed to visit me only at certain times of the day. In those times, the nurses would stay up and regale me with stories from their hometowns and how even they missed their friends and parents back home.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [9]
>>
