887 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Through my entire ordeal, my parents were the ones who lived the whole experience beside me. Every time I winced as a needle penetrated my skin, they too felt the pain. They recognised what a tough time it was for me and did their best to keep me positive and energised at all times. At mealtimes, they would take turns reading to me by my bedside and despite the circumstances, those are some of my most cherished memories. )
/E (Through my entire ordeal, my parents were the ones who lived the whole experience beside me. Every time I winced as a needle penetrated my skin, they too felt the pain. They recognised what a tough time it was for me and did their best to keep me positive and energised at all times. At mealtimes, they would take turns reading to me by my bedside and despite the circumstances, those are some of my most cherished memories. )
