/T (The lady was still reminiscing when a clear note rang through the park. It was followed by another, then another until sound swelled through the crisp winter air. It began to permeate her senses. As the music came alive, her eyes widened. The piece, though different, had a similar cadence, and she lifted her face to its beauty, as tears spilled down her cheeks. )
