/T (As part of a societal outreach initiative, I work with an orphanage in Bangalore, India. Over the past year, I have spent time with the children in the orphanage supporting them with food, medical checkups and educational support. Compassionate empathy has driven me into action and helped me mobilise other like-minded people to support the children. I have realised that people are naturally empathetic, and willing to step forward and do their best. )
