/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This unlikely duo, a Muslim girl and a Hindu boy, navigate the treacherous garbage mountains to rescue children exposed to the dangers of scavenging. Their relentless mission: to pull these children away from sifting through towering refuse, offering them a chance at education. )
/E (This unlikely duo, a Muslim girl and a Hindu boy, navigate the treacherous garbage mountains to rescue children exposed to the dangers of scavenging. Their relentless mission: to pull these children away from sifting through towering refuse, offering them a chance at education. )
