1099 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Remarkably, they perform their work entirely voluntarily. When I enquire about compensation, they reveal that their sole motivation is to pay forward the opportunity they received. They recounted the story of their transformation from despair to hope. Slum children and rag pickers themselves received an opportunity for education through the same NGO that I was working with. )
/E (Remarkably, they perform their work entirely voluntarily. When I enquire about compensation, they reveal that their sole motivation is to pay forward the opportunity they received. They recounted the story of their transformation from despair to hope. Slum children and rag pickers themselves received an opportunity for education through the same NGO that I was working with. )
