/T (The impact of studying through the organization, Pratham, was life-changing. Born into abject poverty, education became their transformative force, offering skills that not only changed their destinies but uplifted their families from the clutches of destitution. Now, with the same fervour, they are committed to rescuing others. )
/E (The impact of studying through the organization, Pratham, was life-changing. Born into abject poverty, education became their transformative force, offering skills that not only changed their destinies but uplifted their families from the clutches of destitution. Now, with the same fervour, they are committed to rescuing others. )
