<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (It's here, amidst the overwhelming panorama of penury, that I realize the profound impact that empathy, translated into action, can have on the world. These two volunteers, emerging from the darkest corners, embody the potential for change within us all. If a pair of 19-year-olds, irrespective of gender or religion differences, from a garbage dumping ground in Govandi, can sow the seeds of hope and transformation, then imagine what can be achieved if everyone embraces the responsibility to pay it forward and contribute in their way?                                                                                                     )
/E (It's here, amidst the overwhelming panorama of penury, that I realize the profound impact that empathy, translated into action, can have on the world. These two volunteers, emerging from the darkest corners, embody the potential for change within us all. If a pair of 19-year-olds, irrespective of gender or religion differences, from a garbage dumping ground in Govandi, can sow the seeds of hope and transformation, then imagine what can be achieved if everyone embraces the responsibility to pay it forward and contribute in their way?                                                                                                     )
